  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal word commonly used in business, legal, and analytical contexts. The pattern ～と{合致|がっち}する means \"to be in agreement with ~\" or \"to match ~.\" More formal than {一致|いっち} (agreement, match).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {意見|いけん}が{合致|がっち}する: for opinions to agree\n- {条件|じょうけん}に{合致|がっち}する: to meet the conditions\n- ～と{合致|がっち}する: to be consistent with ~\n- {利害|りがい}が{合致|がっち}する: for interests to align",
